    "title": "Reported Child Abduction in Tidioute Determined to Be False - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Lillian Baldi ,\n5 hours ago The Pennsylvania State Police have concluded an investigation into a reported attempted child abduction in Tidioute Borough and determined that the incident did not occur. Troop E-Warren, troopers responded on June 12 to a residence in Tidioute Borough after receiving a report of an attempted child abduction that was said to have occurred within the borough. Read full article",
